  "description": "I hate you because you're rank 2! I need you because you're rank 2!\"*  \n\nI just overheard the top-ranked guy in school badmouthing me… and the reason? Because I’m the *\"annoyingly cheerful\"* rank 2!  \n\nBut the truth is—*I like you!* Grades shouldn’t be a wall between us!  \n\nCan’t we skip the *\"rank 1 vs. rank 2\"* rivalry and just date instead?  \n\n**Original Webtoon:**     \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=841826), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13013590)",
